  "factor_name": "Calm-regime trend quality",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "shift1((rolling_sum(pct_change(close),20)/rolling_std(pct_change(close),20)) * clip(rolling_std(pct_change(close),60)/rolling_std(pct_change(close),20),0.5,2.0)), then cross-sectional median-center",
    "description": "A 20-day risk-adjusted trend signal, lagged one completed session, scaled by the ratio of 60-day to 20-day realized volatility. The bounded ratio rewards trends whose recent volatility is calmer than their longer baseline while preserving signed direction."
